    note1["`**PRIORITY NIPs (Implemented):**
    • NIP-01: Foundation for all NOSTR functionality
    • NIP-04: Private creator-supporter communication
    • NIP-05: Identity verification and trust
    • NIP-19: User-friendly key formats
    • NIP-23: Long-form creator content
    • NIP-57: Direct Lightning monetization
    • NIP-78: Platform settings and preferences`"]

    note2["`**ROADMAP (Q1 2025):**
    • NIP-02: Social graph for recommendations
    • NIP-09: Content moderation and deletion
    • NIP-25: Engagement metrics (reactions)
    • NIP-26: Advanced key management`"]

    note3["`**SECURITY IMPLEMENTATION:**
    • All signatures use Schnorr (secp256k1)
    • Event IDs are SHA256 hashes
    • Private keys never sent to server
    • Encrypted storage (AES-256-GCM)
    • Extension support for hardware wallets`"]

